Adapted units:
- extensions/memory-core/src/dreaming-consolidation-candidates.ts:
  trusted-origin and interactive-session candidate admission.
- extensions/memory-core/src/memory-entry-origins.ts:
  source registration, union of predecessor lineage and forget tombstones.
- src/agents/memory-write-provenance.ts:
  reserve provenance before content commit and roll both back on failure.
- extensions/memory-core/src/memory-forget.ts:
  preview exact affected lineage, fence reads/reprocessing, remove derived content.

Changes: Kiki uses per-fact source units and scoped IDs rather than whole-session
blacklists. Sources, immutable revisions, independent human adjudications,
lineage, barriers and content cleanup share one SQLite transaction. It preserves
CAS, review/off policy and recoverable delete/undo. It does not run dreaming.

Adapted behavioral tests in test/app/memory/sqliteMemory.test.ts retain upstream
cases from dreaming-consolidation.test.ts, memory-entry-origins.test.ts,
memory-forget-consolidation.test.ts and memory-forget.test.ts: blocked origins,
interactive session admission, failed lineage reservation, predecessor-source
inheritance, mixed-lineage preview and persistent replay prevention.
